rs by settling into a tight range clustered near 158 per dollar over recent months. But on Wednesday it broke out again, unexpectedly weakening toward 160.\n\nThe sudden move underscores just how difficult Japan\u2019s currency has become to trade. Traditional signals such as interest-rate differentials have become less reliable guides, while Bank of Japan tightening, persistent capital outflows and unprecedented intervention have pulled the yen in competing directions.\n\nThe stakes extend far beyond Japan. The yen is one of the world\u2019s most heavily traded currencies, changing hands in some $1.6 trillion of transactions each day. Its", "citation": "The Yen Is Becoming Too Hard for Some Investors to Trade \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-11-12. https://www.livemint.com/market/the-yen-is-becoming-too-hard-for-some-investors-to-trade-11794520064240.html"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "usd_jpy", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 JPY=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPY=X"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"usd_jpy": 1.1}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"usd_jpy": 1.1}}, {"date": "2026-06-12", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"usd_jpy": 1.1}}, {"date": "2025-07-30", "distance": 0.01, "member_z": {"usd_jpy": 1.11}}, {"date": "2024-12-31", "distance": 0.01, "member_z": {"usd_jpy": 1.1}}, {"date": "2026-05-27", "distance": 0.03, "member_z": {"usd_jpy": 1.08}}], "aftermath": {"usd_jpy": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": 0.46, "hit_rate_up": 0.6, "min_pct": -0.59, "max_pct": 0.72}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 0.37, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -1.33, "max_pct": 1.48}}, "median_path": [0.0, 0.2, 0.06, 0.07, 0.25, 0.46, 0.44, 0.47, 0.57, 0.44, 0.72, 0.77, 0.56, 0.45, 0.58, -0.48]}, "sp500": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 0.2, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -0.28, "max_pct": 0.47}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 1.9, "hit_rate_up": 0.75, "min_pct": -2.16, "max_pct": 3.16}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.22, 0.79, -0.04, 0.47, 